# Small runs

One batch per run. Write the plan to a checked-in file or a `/tmp` plan
file. Commit after each batch. Resume from git state, not from chat
memory.

**Models:** default Composer 2.5 with `fast: false`. Step up to Grok 4.7
at medium effort with `fast: false` only when needed. No Fast mode. No
third-party models.

Details: `.cursor/skills/small-runs`.
